  "body": "For more information, please download the files within the link: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/FUZE\r\n\r\nIgnore the CV. The owners have already purchased their next home, and their focus is firmly on getting this one sold! Positioned on a generous 650m2 site in a quiet pocket of Millwater, this impressive family home brings together expansive living, all-day sunshine and exceptional outdoor entertaining.\r\n\r\nLight-filled open plan living centres around a spacious kitchen with a large island bench and walk-in pantry, while multiple ranch sliders open to an expansive north-facing wraparound deck, covered entertaining area and generous lawns with room for a future pool. A separate media room and additional upstairs lounge provide plenty of space, with unobstructed 180-degree views, including glimpses of the ocean and estuary, adding to the appeal. Spacious bedrooms, a dedicated office and a master suite with ensuite and walk-in wardrobe provide room for everyone, while excellent storage, heat pumps and oversized garaging with storage, and additional parking for the boat or camper add further practicality.\r\n\r\n* Expansive north-facing wraparound decking\r\n* Covered outdoor entertaining and generous lawns\r\n* Three separate living areas plus dedicated office\r\n* Spacious kitchen with island and walk-in pantry\r\n* Master suite with double shower, bath and walk-in wardrobe\r\n* Family bathroom with bath and tiled shower\r\n* Heat pumps and excellent storage throughout\r\n* Oversized double garage with additional parking\r\n* Quiet neighbourhood setting with ocean and estuary glimpses\r\n* Quality GJ Gardner build with weatherboard exterior\r\n\r\nSet in the heart of Millwater, directly opposite Butler Stoney Reserve, with local schools, shops and cafes within walking distance, along with nearby parks, playgrounds and walking trails, this is a fantastic location for families wanting space, convenience and a great neighbourhood to call home.\r\n\r\nWe work with all agencies from day one.",
